Testing
-------

Comment-only changes.  `git gcc-verify` passes on every commit in the
series.  A full `check-gfortran` + `check-target-libgomp-fortran`
rerun on the series branch `testsuite/contributed-by-audit-2026-04`
confirms the changes are a pure no-op at build/test time (to be rerun
before posting).

